      "title": "GitHub mutuals on AI in life sciences or bioinformatics",
      "summary": "Dear all. Does anybody here build applications for AI in life sciences or bioinformatics? I would love to be mutuals and connected on my github account here: https://github.com/Johnkecops Here are some examples on what I built with my team: Protein domain annotation pipeline from my dissertation: https://github.com/Johnkecops/protein-domain Alzheimer Epigenetics annotation pipeline: https://github.com/Johnkecops/Alzheimer_Epigenetics Camcer Epigenetics annotation pipeline: https://github.com/Johnkecops/Epigenetics Please don't hesitate to ask or discuss anything about this field. I also welcome any interest for this field, if you want to know more. Thank you for your attention.",
